# Compiled test/load-harness binaries — never committed.
*.test
harness/harness.test
loadgen/loadgen

# Guard against accidentally-large trace/profile captures. Traces and
# profiles produced by run.sh / driver.sh are kept only while they stay
# under ~20MB (see contention-hunt.md "Reproduction"); anything larger
# should be summarised in the report instead of committed raw.
profiles/*.out
!profiles/trace.out
